{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"I grew up as the only child, so my birthday parties were often just candles, cake, and the quiet hum of my own thoughts, and over time that emptiness became a strange classroom where I learned I could be my own first friend. 🎂 On ordinary nights, the dinner table held only my parents and me, which gave us room to talk in long, unbroken sentences and made their voices feel like the main character of my childhood. 🍽️ As I got older, I realized that I had become the emotional center of the family, holding hopes, worries, and expectations that no sibling shared, and that weight changed how carefully I moved through every decision. ⚖️ Now I meet challenges with a steady, sometimes stubborn independence, and I value relationships that allow silence, space, and honesty instead of constant noise. 🌲","reasoning_content":"The user's request:\n- End every sentence with an emoji.\n- Write a paragraph, personal, in first person.\n- Content: the only child experience shapes outlook on solitude, independence, and family dynamics.\n- Scenes might include: solitary birthdays morphing into insights on self-reliance, quiet dinners that offer space for deep parental bonds, and the mature realization of the weight of carrying family expectations alone.\n- Question: In what ways does being an only child influence one's approach to life's challenges and relationships?\n\nNeed to produce a single paragraph (likely) with every sentence ending with an emoji. Need be careful: \"every sentence\" means each sentence must end with an emoji before/after punctuation? They say \"use an emoji at the end of every sentence.\" So each sentence should have an emoji at the end, likely after the period, or emoji as final character. To be safe, make each sentence end with emoji, no trailing punctuation after emoji? But sentence needs period? Could do \"Text emoji.\" or \"Text. emoji\"? They asked emoji at end of every sentence; if I put em